==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{der|is|non|hvenær}}.

===Adverb===
{{head|is|adverb}}

# [[when]]
#: '''''Hvenær''' er von á þér?''
#:: '''When''' may we expect you?
#: '''''Hvenær''' áttu afmæli?''
#:: '''When''' is your birthday?

====Usage notes====
This word is only used as an interrogative pronoun. In statements, the word ''{{l|is|þegar}}'' is used.

